ure Analysis\n","# Based on package.json, the app uses React, Vite, and Google's GenAI.\n","# Potential integration points could be within the React components or via APIs.\n","# The metadata.json file reveals limited information about the application's structure.\n","\n","# User Interaction Patterns\n","# df_social_marketing suggests users manage tasks, content, and possibly\n","# collaborate. The 'Label' and 'Status' columns hint at different task types and\n","# progress. The rainbowbeast sidekick could assist in task prioritization,\n","# deadline reminders, or content generation based on labels or status.\n","\n","\n","# Rainbowbeast Sidekick Capabilities Analysis\n","# df_rainbowbeast shows financial transaction data (deposits, withdrawals, etc.).\n","# Transaction amounts, frequencies, and currencies could be used to define pricing tiers.\n","# For instance, higher transaction volumes or usage of multiple currencies could unlock\n","# premium features.  The 'Way' column might help categorize transactions.\n","\n","\n","# Integration Point Prioritization\n","# Prioritize integration into the task management workflow.\n","# A potential UI modification could show rainbowbeast-driven insights (e.g., transaction summary)\n","# alongside each task in df_social_marketing. An API endpoint for retrieving financial data\n","# could also be valuable.\n","\n","\n","# Preliminary Tier Design\n","# Tier 1: Basic - Access to transaction summaries and basic financial insights.\n","# Tier 2: Premium - Advanced analytics, transaction forecasting, and alerts.\n","# Tier 3: Enterprise - Custom integrations, priority support, and tailored insights.\n","# Tiers could be based on monthly transaction volume from df_rainbowbeast,\n","# the number of unique currencies used, or a combination.\n","\n","print(\"Analysis and tier design complete.\")"],"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"T47UynJTIzQr","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp