ics\", \"description\": \"Detailed charts, trend analysis, and custom reports.\", \"priority\": 1},\n","            {\"name\": \"Transaction forecasting\", \"description\": \"Predictive models for future spending/income.\", \"priority\": 2},\n","            {\"name\": \"Alerts\", \"description\": \"Customizable alerts for unusual transactions or spending patterns.\", \"priority\": 3},\n","        ],\n","        \"pricing_model\": \"Subscription-based (monthly/annual), tiered based on transaction volume.\",\n","        \"implementation\": \"Enhance existing React components with interactive charts and reporting features. Develop new API endpoints for forecasting and alerts.  Utilize existing data processing capabilities and potentially explore libraries in package.json like @google/genai for forecasting.\",\n","        \"data_requirements\": \"Transaction data from 'df_rainbowbeast' (all columns).  Additional data (e.g., historical market trends) may be beneficial for forecasting.\",\n","    },\n","    \"Enterprise\": {\n","        \"target_user\": \"Businesses with high transaction volumes and complex financial needs.\",\n","        \"key_features\": [\n","            {\"name\": \"Custom integrations\", \"description\": \"Integration with third-party accounting software.\", \"priority\": 1},\n","            {\"name\": \"Priority support\", \"description\": \"Dedicated support channel and faster response times.\", \"priority\": 2},\n","            {\"name\": \"Tailored insights\", \"description\": \"Personalized reports and analysis based on specific business needs.\", \"priority\": 3},\n","        ],\n","        \"pricing_model\": \"Custom pricing based on usage, including transaction volume and support requirements.\",\n","        \"implementation\": \"Develop new API endpoints for custom integrations.  Explore potential libraries in package.json to facilitate integration.  May require backend modifications to handle large datasets and complex requests. Dedicated s